set_option maxRecDepth 20000 in
/-- 2:D6 [value], 00:C14 — on `𝔽₁₇` the frame `g = 3` reads `i = 4` (even: `e^{iπ} = +1`) and the frame
`g = 6` reads `i = 13` (odd: `e^{iπ} = −1`); `6 = 3^{15}` with `15 ≡ 3 (mod 4)` flips the orientation. -/
