/-- 1:B2 [value] — on `𝔽₁₃` the fourth roots of unity are `{1, 5, 12, 8}`, and every other nonzero
residue has four distinct companions `{x, −x, x⁻¹, −x⁻¹}`: the two Klein orbits `{2, 11, 7, 6}` and
