/-- 14:B12 — the instances on the lock `C₁₂ × C₁₂`: the diagonal drive `(x, y) ↦ (x + 1, y + 1)` returns every
point after `12` steps, `x + 12 = x`, and not before, `x + k ≠ x` for `0 < k < 12`; it keeps the offset,
